  "description": "VibeX code 26 — Build something worth sharing. Join Admitiy for a free, 12-hour online hackathon hosted on Discord on 15 November 2026, from 9:00 AM to 9:00 PM IST. Bring your ideas, build a project, and compete for a Winner’s Certificate. How to Register Complete registration with your name and email address. You may share a link to previous work, GitHub, or a portfolio. This is optional and is not required to participate. Who Can Participate Students, beginners, and experienced builders are welcome. Participate solo or in a team of up to 4 members. Members from different colleges and specialisations may team up. Entry is completely free. Format and Rules The hackathon runs from 9:00 AM to 9:00 PM IST on 15 November 2026. The challenge brief and submission instructions will be shared at the start on Discord. Submit your project by 9:00 PM IST. Include a short description, a project or repository link, and a demo or screenshots. Build your submission during the event. Disclose any pre-existing code, third-party resources, and AI tools used. Respect licences, credit sources, and do not submit another person’s work as your own. Be respectful to all participants. Projects will be assessed on usefulness, originality, implementation, and clarity of presentation. Prize First place: Winner’s Certificate.",
