    "details": "<p><strong>VibeX code 26 &mdash; Build something worth sharing.</strong></p>\n<p>Join Admitiy for a free, 12-hour online hackathon hosted on Discord on 15 November 2026, from 9:00 AM to 9:00 PM IST. Bring your ideas, build a project, and compete for a Winner&rsquo;s Certificate.</p>\n<p>How to Register</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Complete registration with your name and email address.</li>\n<li>You may share a link to previous work, GitHub, or a portfolio. This is optional and is not required to participate.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Who Can Participate</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Students, beginners, and experienced builders are welcome.</li>\n<li>Participate solo or in a team of up to 4 members.</li>\n<li>Members from different colleges and specialisations may team up.</li>\n<li>Entry is completely free.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Format and Rules</p>\n<ul>\n<li>The hackathon runs from 9:00 AM to 9:00 PM IST on 15 November 2026.</li>\n<li>The challenge brief and submission instructions will be shared at the start on Discord.</li>\n<li>Submit your project by 9:00 PM IST.</li>\n<li>Include a short description, a project or repository link, and a demo or screenshots.</li>\n<li>Build your submission during the event.</li>\n<li>Disclose any pre-existing code, third-party resources, and AI tools used.</li>\n<li>Respect licences, credit sources, and do not submit another person&rsquo;s work as your own.</li>\n<li>Be respectful to all participants.</li>\n<li>Projects will be assessed on usefulness, originality, implementation, and clarity of presentation.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Prize</p>\n<ul>\n<li>First place: Winner&rsquo;s Certificate.</li>\n</ul>",
